{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は\n『AKB48のオールナイトニッポン 乃木坂46SP』\nに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆ、玲香、なーちゃん、愛未、わか、中田\nで出演させていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/16/7910714/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！94年組！\n呼んでもらえてよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/16/7910714/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜のクリスマスショーの『偶然を言い訳にして』でできた傷口が\nこれでやっと癒えました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスの話たくさんしたけど\nクリスマスってやっぱりそういう日なのね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田的には毎年クリスマスは\nクリスマスケーキしか頭に無いんだけども～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デートプランは\n妄想が膨らんでキュンキュンしますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/16/7910714/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相談室は\nいいアンサーを返せていたのかわかりませんけど\n良かったら参考にしてくださいね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメで体調について言ってたから\n生放送だし心配かけちゃったと思うけど\n熱はもう無いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフだったので\n昼寝もたくさんして\n可能な限り万全な状態で行ったしね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はもう\nしんどくもないし寒気もなくて\nあとちょっとで完全に治りそう感がすごいの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/16/7910714/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう明日には治ってるかな～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ANNに万全な状態で行けなかったのは\n悔しいけど\nでも楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/16/7910714/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな聴いてくれてありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/16/7910714/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンダル..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/16/7910714/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は沈金だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/16/7910714/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}